---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Terms of Service" description="CricBreakdown's terms of service.">
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-5 md:px-8 pt-16 pb-24">
    <span class="stat-chip text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-leather">Legal</span>
    <h1 class="font-display font-bold text-3xl md:text-4xl text-pitch mt-2 mb-8">Terms of Service</h1>

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none prose-headings:font-display prose-headings:text-pitch prose-a:text-leather">
      <p><em>Last updated: [insert date before publishing]</em></p>

      <h2>About this site</h2>
      <p>
        CricBreakdown is an independent fan site providing cricket analysis
        and commentary. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected
        to the BCCI, ICC, IPL, or any cricket franchise referenced on this
        site. Team names and logos, where mentioned, belong to their
        respective owners and are referenced for editorial commentary only.
      </p>

      <h2>Use of content</h2>
      <p>
        All original analysis, writing, and graphics on this site are the
        property of CricBreakdown unless otherwise noted. You may share links
        to our articles freely. Reproducing full articles elsewhere without
        permission is not allowed.
      </p>

      <h2>No warranty</h2>
      <p>
        Content is provided for informational and entertainment purposes.
        Statistics are compiled from publicly available sources and, while we
        aim for accuracy, we cannot guarantee it is error-free.
      </p>

      <h2>Advertising</h2>
      <p>
        This site may display third-party advertising, including through
        Google AdSense. We are not responsible for the content of ads shown.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>
        These terms may be updated from time to time. Continued use of the
        site after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated terms.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions can be sent to
        <a href="mailto:hello@cricbreakdown.com">hello@cricbreakdown.com</a>.
      </p>

      <p class="text-sm text-ink/40 mt-10">
        Note: this is a starting template, not legal advice. Review with a
        qualified professional before publishing.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
